1.6 Beeswarm
Points packed across their band so none overlap (:fit squeezes a swarm that is too wide into its band). A colour mapping makes groups; inside a band groups dodge by default, so the coloured beeswarm sets :position :overlay (each species is alone in its band anyway), and the box opts out of the colour with :mapping {:color nil}.
Source: R Graph Gallery - Beeswarm (1, 2, 3). Data: Edgar Anderson’s iris measurements, R datasets package iris (Anderson 1935; Fisher 1936); licence: Part of R (GPL-2 | GPL-3).

(plot/render-image
 (plot/arrange [{:data iris :mapping {:x :sepal-length :y :species}
                 :charts [(chart/beeswarm {:size 6})]
                 :labels {:title "basic" :x "sepal length" :y nil}}
                {:data iris :mapping {:x :sepal-length :y :species} :flip true
                 :charts [(chart/beeswarm {:size 6})]
                 :labels {:title "vertical (:flip)" :x "sepal length" :y nil}}
                {:data mtcars :mapping {:x :mpg :y :cyl} :scales {:y {:type :categorical}}
                 :charts [(chart/beeswarm {:size 12 :shape \A :color [215 48 39 200]})]
                 :labels {:title "dot style (:shape, :size)" :x "mpg" :y "cylinders"}}
                {:data iris :mapping {:x :petal-length :y :species :color :species}
                 :charts [(chart/box {:outliers false :color [235 235 240] :width 0.6 :mapping {:color nil}})
                          (chart/beeswarm {:size 5 :position :overlay})]
                 :labels {:title "coloured, over boxes" :x "petal length" :y nil}}]
               {:columns 2})
 {:width 1000 :height 700})

2.6 Accessibility

2.6.1 Colour-blind preview
plot/cvd-image shows an image as seen with a colour vision deficiency (the render option :cvd does the same for a whole plot). The default palette as most people see it, then with deuteranopia, protanopia and tritanopia.
Source: R Graph Gallery - viridis (colour-blind friendly maps). Data: Edgar Anderson’s iris measurements, R datasets package iris (Anderson 1935; Fisher 1936); licence: Part of R (GPL-2 | GPL-3).

(let [image (plot/render-image {:data iris :mapping {:x :sepal-length :y :sepal-width :color :species}
                                :charts [(chart/scatter {:size 7})]
                                :labels {:title "default palette" :x "sepal length" :y "sepal width"}}
                               {:width 480 :height 340})
      cell (fn [caption img] (kind/hiccup [:div [:p [:b caption]] img]))]
  (kind/table
   {:row-vectors [[(cell "as most people see it" image) (cell "deuteranopia" (plot/cvd-image image :deuteranopia))]
                  [(cell "protanopia" (plot/cvd-image image :protanopia)) (cell "tritanopia" (plot/cvd-image image :tritanopia))]]}))











